          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നേടുക — nēṭuka — \"to achieve; to gain\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവൾ പരീക്ഷയിൽ ഒന്നാം സ്ഥാനം നേടി. avaḷ parīkṣayil onnāṁ sthānaṁ nēṭi. She achieved first place in the exam."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: നേടി, nēṭi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its past is നേടി: ഒന്നാം സ്ഥാനം നേടി, won first place."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നേടുക (nēṭuka) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3766 lists Malayalam nēṭuka, \"to obtain, to get\", with Tamil nēṭu, \"to seek, to earn\"."
            }
          ]
        },
